  "goodToKnow": "Die Mitgift is a dowry, money or goods a bride brought into marriage. It preserves an old meaning of Gift as gift (feminine die Gift); today das Gift (neuter) means poison, and a present is das Geschenk. The household linen in the Aussteuer chest was part of it. Figuratively, eine Mitgift can be an inheritance of traits: eine genetische Mitgift. Plural: die Mitgiften."
